\title{muiPersonalWebsite: Personal Site Generator Using 'muiMaterial'}
\description{
Builds a personal website from YAML alone. Every element of every page is a 'muiMaterial' component, from the app bar to the footer, with the 'head' metadata written at build time. A configuration file names the sections; each section is a content file of projects, apps or talks; and mui_create_site() writes a working site to start from. It is the generator behind felixluginbuhl.com, and the functions themselves double as worked examples of 'muiMaterial' in production.
